 "notes": "No bracketed old names seen. Seegar Avenue is printed SEEGAR (north part and the SW diagonal) and SEGAR (between Knox and Waverly); kept as one name. Two separate Montrose sections: west (Richter to Clifford) and east (x~3140-3880, Merton/Elizabeth). Two Seegar sections: north (Carll to Everglade Place) and south of Queen City. Hillenbrand Avenue north of Fairmount is printed only AVE. Sedley Street could also read SEELEY. Wickham east of Biesler is only a block alley. Queen City Avenue's south line is often not drawn; its centre was estimated from the north line where needed. Unnamed (?): N-S STREET stub off Biegler (x~1203); E-W street from Richter past Hillenbrand (y~5770); E-W street with railroad east of Rankin printed only ST. Gutter overlap with 22-33R (R = L - (5550,28)): Trevor Place/Baltimore, Abbott/Holden, Abbott/Judson. City steps (north of Everglade, south of McBrayer) not recorded. Unnamed alleys not recorded: block 64 alley east of Biesler, J.A.J.&M.E. Wickham alley (y~6570), ALLEY east of Rankin (y~6315)."
}